  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A Chu Sect Gu Immortal introduces him among Chu Du’s hired experts with an evasive gaze. He has rank seven cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        1168
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_chu_sect",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_chu_du"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He has a square face, thick brows and huge eyes, a very tall nose bridge, and thick black hair exposed on his chest. He is a man but wears a flowery skirt. Seeing Fang Yuan he pulls the skirt and speaks seductively. Fang Yuan tells him to stay away and other invited immortals feel goosebumps.",
      "chapters": [
        1168
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The same square face, thick eyebrows, huge eyes, tall nose bridge, exposed chest hair, and flowery skirt return at Chu tribe headquarters, with a feminine voice as he taps his fingers together.",
      "chapters": [
        2202
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "On the approach to Iron Eagle blessed land he praises Chu Du with attraction and infatuation while Hao Zhen and Chou Lao Wu move away from him. He names Immortal Wang’s white hound form as the immemorial desolate beast heaven swallowing hound.",
      "chapters": [
        1169
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-raid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_iron_eagle_blessed_land",
        "char_hao_zhen",
        "char_chou_lao_wu",
        "char_immortal_wang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the blessed land he fights with Hao Zhen and Chou Lao Wu. Bai Zu tribe’s united Gu Immortals suppress the three rank sevens despite inferior individual strength, and he shouts to retreat first. He enters through Immortal Wang’s gap, claims soft jades on a beach, and curses how poor Bai Zu tribe’s resource points are.",
      "chapters": [
        1170
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-raid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_bai_zu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He arrives again while Immortal Wang runs as a falling star hound, rolls his eyes at Wang’s excuses, then screams when Green City Rampage appears.",
      "chapters": [
        1171
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-raid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_green_city_rampage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the formation breaks he has a pale flowery appearance and asks what to do. He says he is skilled at healing techniques and moves to help Immortal Wang, which sparks Chou Lao Wu’s anger at Wang’s shamelessness.",
      "chapters": [
        1172
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "iron-eagle-raid",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chu Du asks Fang Yuan to reinforce him when his side is in danger. He and Immortal Wang are already in a tough battle against desolate beast wolves, and he cries out in joy when he senses Liu Guan Yi.",
      "chapters": [
        1177
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-fan-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Hao Zhen and Chou Lao Wu spend themselves on Wind Thunder Roar, he flies to escort their retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        1178
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-fan-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_wind_thunder_roar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Chu Du flies out for the blood battle martial competition, Li Si Chun stands in Chu Du’s battle formation with Hao Zhen, Chou Lao Wu, Immortal Wang, and others opposite Bai Zu tribe allies.",
      "chapters": [
        1194
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chu-sect-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At Chu tribe headquarters on the day of Fairy Black Moon’s challenge he holds Immortal Wang while Chou Lao Wu pulls Hao Zhen away, urging them not to fight inside the tribe. He sighs that asking Fang Yuan for help would be great, then stands with Hao Zhen, Chou Lao Wu, and Immortal Wang as external elders facing anxious newcomers. Narration says the real crisis is worse than what he and the rest discussed.",
      "chapters": [
        2202
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "chu-tribe-crisis",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    }
  ],
